{"n":91,"ar":"الشمس","name":"Ash-Shams","mean":"The Sun","type":"meccan","v":[{"a":["وَٱلشَّمۡسِ","وَضُحَىٰهَا"],"w":["By the sun","and its brightness"],"t":["wal-shamsi","waḍuḥāhā"],"p":[1,2],"en":"By the sun and its brightness"},{"a":["وَٱلۡقَمَرِ","إِذَا","تَلَىٰهَا"],"w":["And the moon","when","it follows it"],"t":["wal-qamari","idhā","talāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the moon when it follows it"},{"a":["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","إِذَا","جَلَّىٰهَا"],"w":["And the day","when","it displays it"],"t":["wal-nahāri","idhā","jallāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the day when it displays it"},{"a":["وَٱلَّيۡلِ","إِذَا","يَغۡشَىٰهَا"],"w":["And the night","when","it covers it"],"t":["wa-al-layli","idhā","yaghshāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the night when it covers it"},{"a":["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَمَا","بَنَىٰهَا"],"w":["And the heaven","and (He) Who","constructed it"],"t":["wal-samāi","wamā","banāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it"},{"a":["وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ","وَمَا","طَحَىٰهَا"],"w":["And the earth","and by (He) Who","spread it"],"t":["wal-arḍi","wamā","ṭaḥāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it"},{"a":["وَنَفۡسࣲ","وَمَا","سَوَّىٰهَا"],"w":["And (the) soul","and (He) Who","proportioned it"],"t":["wanafsin","wamā","sawwāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it"},{"a":["فَأَلۡهَمَهَا","فُجُورَهَا","وَتَقۡوَىٰهَا"],"w":["And He inspired it","(to distinguish) its wickedness","and its righteousness"],"t":["fa-alhamahā","fujūrahā","wataqwāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness"},{"a":["قَدۡ","أَفۡلَحَ","مَن","زَكَّىٰهَا"],"w":["Indeed","he succeeds","who","purifies it"],"t":["qad","aflaḥa","man","zakkāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"He has succeeded who purifies it"},{"a":["وَقَدۡ","خَابَ","مَن","دَسَّىٰهَا"],"w":["And indeed","he fails","who","buries it"],"t":["waqad","khāba","man","dassāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4],"en":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption]"},{"a":["كَذَّبَتۡ","ثَمُودُ","بِطَغۡوَىٰهَآ"],"w":["Denied","Thamud","by their transgression"],"t":["kadhabat","thamūdu","biṭaghwāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"Thamud denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression"},{"a":["إِذِ","ٱنۢبَعَثَ","أَشۡقَىٰهَا"],"w":["When","(was) sent forth","(the) most wicked of them"],"t":["idhi","inbaʿatha","ashqāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth"},{"a":["فَقَالَ","لَهُمۡ","رَسُولُ","ٱللَّهِ","نَاقَةَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَسُقۡيَٰهَا"],"w":["But said","to them","(the) Messenger","(of) Allah","(It is the) she-camel","(of) Allah","and her drink"],"t":["faqāla","lahum","rasūlu","l-lahi","nāqata","l-lahi","wasuq'yāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"en":"And the messenger of Allah [Salih] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allah or [prevent her from] her drink"},{"a":["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","فَعَقَرُوهَا","فَدَمۡدَمَ","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","رَبُّهُم","بِذَنۢبِهِمۡ","فَسَوَّىٰهَا"],"w":["But they denied him","and they hamstrung her","So destroyed","them","their Lord","for their sin","and leveled them"],"t":["fakadhabūhu","faʿaqarūhā","fadamdama","ʿalayhim","rabbuhum","bidhanbihim","fasawwāhā"],"p":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"en":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them]"},{"a":["وَلَا","يَخَافُ","عُقۡبَٰهَا"],"w":["And not","He fears","its consequences"],"t":["walā","yakhāfu","ʿuq'bāhā"],"p":[1,2,3],"en":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof"}]}